WEBVTT

00:42.852 --> 00:52.459
The engine hums, a steady beat 30,000 tired feet

00:53.239 --> 00:59.184
Above the clouds, a sea of white Escaping from

00:59.204 --> 01:06.550
the endless night Your hand in mine A steady

01:06.650 --> 01:14.372
grace The only anchor in this place You let me

01:14.472 --> 01:21.854
lean against your side With nothing left to run

01:22.134 --> 01:24.295
or hide

01:27.115 --> 01:33.577
And for the first time in so long I can breathe

01:38.398 --> 01:41.720
Quiet promise,

01:42.500 --> 01:48.424
I believe

01:48.464 --> 01:52.426
Your shoulder is my only home right now A silent,

01:52.466 --> 01:56.849
true and sacred vow A sanctuary in the sky

01:56.869 --> 02:00.811
Beneath a calm and endless eye Is all I need to

02:00.891 --> 02:07.495
feel okay And chase the lingering far away

02:10.576 --> 02:17.900
I think about the static sound on that unholy

02:18.160 --> 02:25.443
hollow ground. I think about the pouring rain,

02:25.904 --> 02:31.767
the endless fear, the burning pain. But then I

02:31.827 --> 02:38.552
feel you squeeze my hand And I begin to

02:39.092 --> 02:46.177
understand The storm has passed, the war is done

02:46.618 --> 02:50.461
A quiet battle has been won

02:54.867 --> 03:02.416
And for the first time in so long I can breathe

03:05.920 --> 03:08.363
A quiet promise

03:10.225 --> 03:12.808
I believe

03:16.160 --> 03:20.143
Your shoulder is my only home right now A silent,

03:20.203 --> 03:24.566
true, and sacred vow This sanctuary in the sky

03:24.606 --> 03:28.528
Beneath the calm and endless eye Is all I need to

03:28.608 --> 03:34.652
feel okay And chase the lingering fog away

04:22.749 --> 04:22.890
you

05:12.878 --> 05:16.059
Safe. Thank you.

